        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩvinda ya kũkw’a kwa Isilaeli yathengeea: na amwĩta mwana wake Yosevu, na amwĩa, Ethĩwa yu nĩnona ũseo mbee waku, nĩngũkwĩsũva, ia kw’oko kwaku ungu wa waswa wakwa, ũmbĩke nesa na w’o: nĩngũkwĩsũva, ndũkaanthike kũũ Misili; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
